NOTICE ON THIRD-PARTY INSTRUMENTS

CortexForge implements original task analogues inspired by published
research instruments. It does not reproduce copyrighted instrument items.
Instruments whose stimulus sets or items are restricted (for example the
Reading the Mind in the Eyes Test) are declared in the task registry with
licence "restricted" and are never served. Clinical screening instruments
(for example the Adult ADHD Self-Report Scale) are declared with licence
"clinical_only" and are never administered or scored.

NOTICE ON HEALTH CLAIMS

CortexForge is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat, cure, or
prevent any disease or condition. It makes no claim to increase intelligence,
prevent cognitive decline, or produce transfer from trained tasks to untrained
ones. Its claims are limited to those enumerated in docs/prd/PRD.md §14.
